! GAMESS/VB2000 Test 43 
! This example demonstrates a multiconfiguration spin-coupled VB approach 
! for the pi system of allyl cation in conjunction with PP-GVB for the 
! two C-C sigma bonds.
!
! This example has been contributed by the group of Andre Barbosa from the
! Instituto de Quimica, Universidade Federal Fluminense, Niteroi, RJ, Brazil
! and is part of the work published in Theoretical Chemistry Accounts,
! (2018) 137-21. We are gratefull to Professor Barbosa for sharing his
! work with the VB2000 community.
!
! The data has been modified from that contributed from the group of Andre
! Barbosa as their data takes a significantly longer time than the other
! tests. Their data used the cc-pVTZ basis set. This test uses the cc-pVDZ
! basis set. Their data read the initial guess with $READGUESS from a file
! called exam-vb43.orb. This test gets the initial data from $04VBORB.
!
! We have also removed the $MOLDEN directive and adding $VECINIT and
! $VECONLY to use MacMolPlt to investigate the final VB orbitals. The
! $SYSTEM block as been altered for a single processor run.
!
! The orginal results from the group of Andre Barbosa can be obtained by
! altering the input file below as follows:-
! 1. Inactivate $04VBORB by removing the $ symbol.
! 2. Activate READGUESS By adding a $ symbol to give $READGUESS.
! 3. Remove the blank line in $VBGA so that it reads 3 entries not 2.
! 4. Change 'ccd' in the $basis group 3 lines below this to 'cct'.
!
 $contrl scftyp=rhf runtyp=energy icharg=1 mult=1 ispher=1 vbtyp=vb2000 $end
 $basis gbasis=ccd $end
 $system timlim=200000 memory=140000000 $end
 $scf fdiff=.f. mvoq=-1 $end
 $DATA
 Cation Allyl: guess from natural orbitals and geo from CASSCF(2,3) 
C1
 C           6.0   0.0003739604   0.4928438748   0.0000000000
 H           1.0   0.0025134081   1.5655406715   0.0000000000
 C           6.0   1.1809527336  -0.2110755399   0.0000000000
 C           6.0  -1.1830335028  -0.2063111164   0.0000000000
 H           1.0  -2.1327899233   0.2963526544   0.0000000000
 H           1.0  -1.1934624472  -1.2809471721   0.0000000000
 H           1.0   1.1870598604  -1.2857418575   0.0000000000
 H           1.0   2.1327092706   0.2877974752   0.0000000000
 $END

 $VB2000

#! VB(2).VB(2).VB(2,4)/cc-pVTZ PRINTALL FROZEN DIIS

ALLYL CATION (2 CC BONDS AND 2 PI ELECTRONS)

1 1

6.0   0.0003739604   0.4928438748   0.0000000000
1.0   0.0025134081   1.5655406715   0.0000000000
6.0   1.1809527336  -0.2110755399   0.0000000000
6.0  -1.1830335028  -0.2063111164   0.0000000000
1.0  -2.1327899233   0.2963526544   0.0000000000
1.0  -1.1934624472  -1.2809471721   0.0000000000
1.0   1.1870598604  -1.2857418575   0.0000000000
1.0   2.1327092706   0.2877974752   0.0000000000

 $MACROITER
 90

 $NOTROT
 3
 1,2
 1,3
 1,4

 $04VBSTR
 2
 1 2
 3 4

 $VBGA
 1-3(1) => 2
 1-4(1) => 3

 1-4(2) => 4

 $04VBORB
 0.32 AO 6 +0.22 AO 9 +0.49 AO 26 +0.31 AO 29
 0.32 AO 6 +0.22 AO 9 +0.49 AO 41 +0.31 AO 44
 0.71 AO 6 +0.30 AO 9
 0.16 AO 9 +0.37 AO 26 +0.30 AO 29 +0.37 AO 41 +0.30 AO 44

 $GRPDIM
 8,2,2,4

 READGUESS
 exam-vb43.orb

 $MEMORY
 140000000

 $VECINIT

 $VECONLY

 $PRINTHS

 $END

